**16,900 grants 5 Uber Rare Catseyes.
*9th anniversary text changed from Q to 9.
*[[Catfruit]] and [[Talent Orbs|Talent Orb]] storage redesign: now displays only one of each type of Catfruit/Orb in the player's possession, with the item's quantity shown underneath its icon. Items also stay still rather than floating around the screen.
